distinct roles. The actual16 paths/caps, final literal growth,8 OS command lengths
and physical capture witnesses remain unknown; no source or native result is proved.

[ROOT choice004](ROOT_REVIEWED_SOURCE_PREPARATION_CHOICES_004.json),
{short('ROOT_REVIEWED_SOURCE_PREPARATION_CHOICES_004.json')}, authorizes **staged source
and test authoring only** after these different reviews. Rawsource004 owns compact
two-middle schema3 with exact EA9->597->3f74->future parents, known9+9/full742,
finite25 final changes, schemas34/36/37/34 and reconstructed grouped263 QA. Preserve
API12/seven files/legacy behavior/records/externalSHA/395799. Nativeclosure003 owns
AST-equal source compaction plus the reviewed byte frame and actual-versus-inserted
