[Guard005 static harness review](consumer-guard-test-runtime005/INDEPENDENT_GUARD_RUNTIME_STATIC_REVIEW_005.json),
{short('consumer-guard-test-runtime005/INDEPENDENT_GUARD_RUNTIME_STATIC_REVIEW_005.json')},
passes **PASS_STATIC_PREPARATION_ONLY**, exact20 keys. All297 frozen files,250 direct
pairs and391 inherited claims across869 finite files stayed stable. Thirteen stale
pins are corrected across five active protocols; all27 fixedSHA declarations derive
from actual005 bytes and all future None keysets remain unchanged. Four wrapper
reversals are exact, typed12/core7 and PS12 string/fiveSHA guards stay correct, active
scratch is checked before root start/capture/process. Both author utility errors and
