[Read-only metadata preparer review]({metadata_peer.relative_to(base).as_posix()}),
{digest(inputs[metadata_peer.relative_to(root).as_posix()])[:8]}, records
**{meta_peer_body['verdict']}**. The22-file source preparation observes current742,
HEAD/index/config and FOUR runtime files, with ZERO inventory trees. Normal porcelain
only is observed; no ignored-clean claim. Its nine digest/three path slots remain
None in the template. Before/after are separate one-use phases; actual bound source,
bound review and fresh root phase authorizations remain ahead. Its supporting-PS
