whole-before acceptance, bound22/late14 and root first-entry ACK are prerequisites
to the copied14 tests; none have executed. Metadata24/stdlib runtime harness is also
being prepared, with actual collection/subtests/results unknown.

The actor's [gate009 continuation receipt](../{continuation}) records
{started['utc']}, replacement {started['replacement_run']}, accepted_before1 and
44 remaining; its helper pin is {started['helper_sha256']}. ROOT read these bytes
as metadata only, did not launch the continuation or review historical first entry,
and accepts no replacement result/final5575 gate. Original failed driver/heavy001
stay spent with null result/JUnit; timeout cause remains an actor claim. D177008
