finite policy/release009/native acceptance. All actor source/commits/evidence remain.

[Coordination012](COORDINATION_GATE009_TIMEOUT_RESOURCE_REQUEST_012.md) is a local
Root/Pro3 bridge without delivery/STOP/sole-transfer ACK or lease. The recorded06:47
resource snapshot is time-local, not a reservation; PID62728 ownership/RAM cause unproved.
Pro3 component/heavy/qualification and durable quiet are still held/unagreed. Copied
