update follows reconciliation, not during the proof interval.

Science remains E2A150local/149synced/111untouched/299events; Gate1FAIL/H2H3untested.
Preserve frozen science/outcomes, twins, existing epoch, D177/D178/history83/84 and
all spent helpers. Recovery111fits requires proofs; seal precedes downstream fits.
Root canonical apply/fullQA/newgate/commit/native remains HELD without sole executor
agreement. Original caps/reserves/pipedGO/noNonInteractive/no-public/no-push/no-replay/
no-extraepoch stay. Keeper launch is consumed; monitor restoration remains due at
