'''
primary = [root / 'AGENTS.md', root / 'HANDOFF.md', root / 'START_HERE.md',
           root / 'resume-2026-09-28-001/SESSION.md', base / 'RESOURCE_COORDINATION.md']
old = {p: p.read_bytes() for p in primary}
header = f'''**MAJOR STEP020 - GUARD005 STATIC PASS; READONLY METADATA PREPARER REVIEWED; NEW RAW/FRAME SOURCE AUTHORING ONLY.**
Recorded {stamp}. Owner ends2026-10-02T22:36:15Z. Read [checkpoint020](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_020.md), HANDOFF, START_HERE and newest SESSION.
ROOT019peer{short('INDEPENDENT_DOCS_REFRESH_REVIEW_019.json')} passes39/26pairs/26links withlegacycanonicalprecision. Correctionpeer{short('INDEPENDENT_COMPACT_CANONICAL_CORRECTION_REVIEW_001.json')} provesraw7felegacy1/2alreadycanonical line3543; future3extends/preserves, falseoldpremise retained. Nativeframe3peer0cae conditionalSTATIC/UNBINDABLE/current268978overcap/canonicalmax262142/actual16paths-caps-growth-8argv-OSwitnessNone. Rootchoice{short('ROOT_REVIEWED_SOURCE_PREPARATION_CHOICES_004.json')} authorizesstagedRaw4+Nativeclosure3 source/testsONLY/nocodeexecution/binding/liveauthority. Guard5peer{short('consumer-guard-test-runtime005/INDEPENDENT_GUARD_RUNTIME_STATIC_REVIEW_005.json')} STATICPASS297/250direct/391inherited/869inputs/13fixedpins27SHA/allNoneunchanged/14UNRUN. Metadata22fileprep peer{digest(inputs[metadata_peer.relative_to(root).as_posix()])[:8]} {meta_peer_body['verdict']}/4runtimefiles0trees/normalstatus/nine+threeNone/ROOTAUTHPS-only0or7—notPy6. Wholeobserver2trees+4files no site/Job/loadedproof. Actualbound/phase/context/resource/whole/bound22/late14/rootACKahead;metadata24UNRUN. Actor009continuation06:50receiptmetadata1accepted44remaining/noresultacceptance/noRootlaunch/soleACK. Rootcanonicalheld/coord12localno delivery/lease/quiet;sciencetwinsepochhistoryspentcapsreserves/pipedGO/noNonInteractive/no-public/no-replay intact/monitorrestorecloseout. Earlier bytes exacthistory.

'''.encode('utf-8')
def root_link(match):
    target = match.group(1)
    return '](' + (target[3:] if target.startswith('../') else 'resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/' + target) + ')'
handoff = re.sub(r'\]\(([^)]+)\)', root_link,
                 body.replace('# Major step020 - copied guard launcher reviewed; staged proof and frame authoring authorized',
                              '# Current pro2 handoff - major step020')).encode('utf-8')
start = b'''# Start here

Read [HANDOFF](HANDOFF.md), [checkpoint020](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_020.md) and newest [SESSION](resume-2026-09-28-001/SESSION.md).

Guard005 launcher passes source review; its14 tests are unrun. Read-only metadata preparer is reviewed with genuine PowerShell-only phase authorization. Fresh actual binding, metadata, resources, whole-before, bound/late reviews and root ACK precede execution. The metadata24-case harness is being prepared.

Raw004 compact two-intermediate policy and Native003 byte frame are authorized for staged source/test authoring only. Legacy1/2 already enforce canonical bytes; preserve that check in3. Actual paths/caps/growth/OS commands and witness remain unknown; no current/native acceptance.

Actor gate009 has an original terminal failure and a continuation start receipt, with no final accepted gate. Root canonical apply/fullQA/release/native stays held without sole-executor agreement. Owner ends2026-10-02T22:36:15Z. Preserve science, twins, epoch, actor history, spent helpers, original caps/reserves and no replay/public action. Monitor restoration due at closeout.
'''
entry = f'''

## {stamp} - ROOT MAJOR020: guard005 static review and staged proof/frame authoring

See [checkpoint020](../resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_020.md). ROOT019peer2c216PASSqualifiedcanonicalprecision/correctionpeer5ad70legacy1/2alreadycanonical3543/falsepremisepreserved. Nativeframe3peer0cae STATICqualifiedUNBINDABLE/current268978over/canonicalmax262142/actualpaths-caps-growth-argv-witnessNone. Rootchoice{short('ROOT_REVIEWED_SOURCE_PREPARATION_CHOICES_004.json')} stagedRaw4/Native3source+testsONLY/no targetexecution/binding/live. Guard5peeraa73STATICPASS297/250direct/391inherited/869inputs/13pins27SHA/Noneunchanged/14UNRUN. Metadata22fileprep peer{digest(inputs[metadata_peer.relative_to(root).as_posix()])[:8]} {meta_peer_body['verdict']}4files0trees/normalonly/future9+3None/PS-onlyAUTH0or7/notPy6. Actualbound/context/resource/2tree4filewhole/bound22/late14/rootonceahead;metadata24UNRUN. Actor009continuation06:50receiptmetadataonly1accepted44remaining/helper0f42/nopass/noRootlaunch/soleACK. Rootcanonicalheld/coord12localno delivery/lease/quiet/science-twins-epoch-history-spent-caps-reserves/pipedGO/noNonInteractive/no-public/no-replay intact/monitorrestorecloseout. Primarydocs fixedduringactualunitproofinterval;ROOT020 needsdifferentdocsreview.
'''.encode('utf-8')
resource_entry = f'''

### {stamp} - major020 separate copied-unit and native scopes

Guard005STATICPASS and metadata preps do not release a lease or quiet host. Four runtimeFILES/zero trees in metadata preparer; separatewholeobserver TWOtrees+fourfiles, not4trees/allsite/loadedclosure. GenuinePS0/7 authorization role required; source/template/bound/phase/context proofs ahead. Guard14 andmetadata24unrun requirefreshRAM1GiB/D10GiB/before-after/actualbound-late/rootonce. Actor009continuation06:50metadataonly/noRootlaunch/noacceptedresult/soleACK. Pro3 holds and no nativequiet remain. Keeperconsumed/monitorrestorecloseout. [Checkpoint020](30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_020.md).
'''.encode('utf-8')
links = []
for p, b in [(primary[0], header), (primary[1], handoff), (primary[2], start),
             (checkpoint, body.encode()), (primary[3], entry), (primary[4], resource_entry)]:
    for target in re.findall(r'\]\(([^)]+)\)', b.decode('utf-8')):
        resolved = (p.parent / target).resolve()
        assert resolved == checkpoint.resolve() or resolved.is_file(), (p, target)
        links.append(dict(document=p.relative_to(root).as_posix(), target=target, resolved_path=str(resolved)))
def once(p, b):
    p.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
    with p.open('xb') as stream:
        stream.write(b)
        stream.flush()
        os.fsync(stream.fileno())
for n, b in inputs.items():
    assert (root / n).read_bytes() == b
    once(input_dir / n, b)
for p, b in old.items():
    once(before_dir / p.relative_to(root), b)
once(checkpoint, body.encode('utf-8'))
for p, b in {primary[0]: header + old[primary[0]], primary[1]: handoff, primary[2]: start}.items():
    assert p.read_bytes() == old[p]
    p.write_bytes(b)
for p, b in ((primary[3], entry), (primary[4], resource_entry)):
    assert p.read_bytes() == old[p]
    with p.open('ab') as stream:
        stream.write(b)
def row(p):
    b = p.read_bytes()
    return dict(path=p.relative_to(root).as_posix(), bytes=len(b), sha256=digest(b))
enc = lambda v: (json.dumps(v, indent=2, sort_keys=True, ensure_ascii=True, allow_nan=False)+'\n').encode('ascii')
baseline = []
for p, b in old.items():
    proof = 'exact_before_copy'
    if p.name == 'AGENTS.md':
        assert p.read_bytes().endswith(b)
        proof = 'exact_retained_suffix'
    if p.name in ('SESSION.md', 'RESOURCE_COORDINATION.md'):
        assert p.read_bytes().startswith(b)
        proof = 'exact_retained_prefix'
    baseline.append(dict(primary=p.relative_to(root).as_posix(), before=row(before_dir/p.relative_to(root)), proof=proof))
once(base/'DOCS_REFRESH_BASELINE_020.json', enc(dict(schema_version=1, created_utc=stamp, files=baseline)))
input_rows = [dict(original=row(root/n), copy=row(input_dir/n)) for n in inputs]
once(base/'DOCS_REFRESH_INPUTS_020.json', enc(dict(schema_version=1, created_utc=stamp, inputs=input_rows)))
declared = [*primary, checkpoint, base/'DOCS_REFRESH_BASELINE_020.json', base/'DOCS_REFRESH_INPUTS_020.json',
            *[before_dir/p.relative_to(root) for p in primary], *[input_dir/n for n in inputs]]
facts = dict(guard005=guard_peer['verdict'], metadata_preparer=meta_peer_body['verdict'],
             phase_authorization_producer='GENUINE_POWERSHELL_0_OR7_NOT_PYTHON6',
             canonical_legacy1_2_already_required=True, schema3_preserves_extends_old_check=True,
             choice004='STAGED_SOURCE_TEST_AUTHORING_ONLY', guard14_and_metadata24_executed=False,
             metadata_helper_executed=False, actual_source_or_bound_phase_records_accepted=False,
             native_frame_operationally_bindable=False, actor_continuation_receipt_metadata=True,
             actor_gate009_final_or_replacement_accepted=False, root_actor_continuation_launched=False,
             sole_executor_ack=False, new_lease_or_quiet=False, source_execution_or_live_authority=False,
             primary_docs_fix_during_future_unit_proof_interval=True)
audit = dict(schema_version=1, checkpoint=20, created_utc=stamp,
             status='AWAITING_INDEPENDENT_DOCUMENTATION_REVIEW', files=[row(p) for p in declared],
             actual_input_count=len(input_rows), maintained_links=links, facts=facts)
once(base/'DOCS_REFRESH_AUDIT_020.json', enc(audit))
print(json.dumps(dict(checkpoint_sha256=digest(checkpoint.read_bytes()), audit_sha256=digest(enc(audit)),
                      declared_files=len(declared), inputs=len(input_rows), maintained_links=len(links))))
